+  // output samples. Bit-identical by construction - a hit returns exactly
+  // what cmsDoTransform() returned for the same quantized inputs. Real
+  // documents evaluate few distinct colors relative to calls (per-pixel
+  // GetRGB() on inverted-Decode CMYK scans: millions of calls, tens of
